        <!-- KURSAD_BORE_COLLISION_END -->
        <!--
          FUSION GEOMETRY (Payload_Capture_Body_V1). The 0.14 x 0.05 x 0.07 box
          that used to be here was a hand-entered stand-in for this CAD; the
          real part measures 142 x 52 x 70 mm, so the box was right to within
          1 mm per side. Meshes come from ~/KURSAD40/cad_exports/payload/ via
          Tools/simulation/gz/cad/update_hook_from_cad.sh and are shared with
          Tools/simulation/gz/models/kursad_payload/.

          UNITS: metres. mm->m is baked into the vertices, not applied with
          <mesh><scale>.

          POSE +0.008: the CAD frame runs z -0.043 (bottom plate underside) to
          +0.027 (deck top), i.e. its origin is 8 mm below the part's mid
          height. The link origin here is the mid height, so the mesh is
          lifted 8 mm to put CAD -0.043/+0.027 exactly on link -0.035/+0.035 -
          the same top and bottom faces the collision box still uses.

          COLOUR IS UNCHANGED, deliberately. The exact ambient/diffuse values
          below are the ones the HSV detector was tuned against (see the
          colour note on payload_blue). The bottom plate is given the same
          colour rather than a neutral one so the part reads as a single
          solid blob from every angle, exactly as the box did - the
          down-facing camera never sees it, but nothing is gained by making
          it a second colour.
        -->
        <visual name="visual">
          <pose>0 0 0.008 0 0 0</pose>
          <geometry><mesh><uri>model://kursad_payload/meshes/payload_body.stl</uri></mesh></geometry>
          <material>
            <ambient>0.75 0.05 0.05 1</ambient>
            <diffuse>0.75 0.05 0.05 1</diffuse>
            <specular>0.2 0.2 0.2 1</specular>
          </material>
        </visual>
        <visual name="bottom_plate_visual">
          <pose>0 0 0.008 0 0 0</pose>
          <geometry><mesh><uri>model://kursad_payload/meshes/payload_bottom_plate.stl</uri></mesh></geometry>
          <material>
            <ambient>0.75 0.05 0.05 1</ambient>
            <diffuse>0.75 0.05 0.05 1</diffuse>
            <specular>0.2 0.2 0.2 1</specular>
          </material>
        </visual>
        <!--
          KANCA YUVASI (2026-08-21, operator: "gercekteki kancamizin altinda
          magnet var ve eger denk gelirse kendi yuvasina girecek").
          Kutu link merkezinde, yerel z [-0.025, +0.025]; yuva onun ustune
          oturur, yerel z [+0.025, +0.045] -> DUNYA z [0.050, 0.070]. Kanca
          ucunun inmesi gereken yukseklik bu 0.070.

          RENK/TESPIT ETKISI: yuva noturr gri, yani ustten bakinca kirmizi
          dikdortgenin icinde kirmizi OLMAYAN bir ada acar. Zararsiz oldugu
          hesaplandi: yuva 0.03 m yaricapla 0.0028 m2, payload ustu
          0.30x0.225 = 0.0675 m2, yani alanin %4.2'si. HSV_COLOR_FRAC_RECT
          esigi 0.40 (yani %40) - doluluk ~%96'da kalir, esikten 2.4x uzak.
          RETR_EXTERNAL kullanildigi icin dis kontur da bolunmez.
        -->
        <!--
          CELIK HEDEF DISKI - YUKUN ICINDE, USTUNDE DEGIL.
          (operator, 2026-08-26: "magneti yukun icindeki deliklere koymak lazim")

          Burada eskiden 20 mm YUKARI TASAN gri bir silindir vardi. Gercek
          parcada oyle bir cikinti YOK: Payload_Capture_Body'nin alici agzi
          guverteden ASAGI dogru oyulmus bir hunidir. Olculer tahmin degil,
          exportlanan mesh'in eksen etrafindaki yaricap profilinden okundu
          (Tools/simulation/gz/cad/, CAD mm cinsinden):

            z 16.50  r 23.25   huni agzi (canak) O46.50
            z 13.00  r 14.50   huni ust duzlemi O29.00
            z  9.00  r 11.00   duz gecis deligi O22.00
            z  5.00  r 13.80   dis boslugu O27.60
            z  0.00 -> -2.20   r 6.50   MIKNATIS YUVASI O13.00
            z -2.20 -> -3.30   r 6.20   HEDEF DISKI CEBI O12.40

          Yani delikler guverte ustunden 27 mm ASAGIDA. PCBV1_PARAMETERS.txt'ye
          gore is bolusumu: miknatis KANCADA (hook_magnet O10 x 2, bkz.
          x500_mono_cam_down/model.sdf hook_magnet_visual), yukun tasidigi parca
          ise bu O12 x 1 celik disk; kanca inince miknatis O13 yuvaya girer ve
          diskin 0.20 mm ustunde durur (magnet_target_clearance).

          Link merkezi CAD z = -8 mm oldugundan yerel z = CAD z + 0.008.
          Cep -2.20..-3.20 -> yerel +0.0058..+0.0048, merkez +0.0053.

          COLLISION YOK: eski yuva silindiri kancanin uzerine oturdugu yuzeydi;
          artik kanca dogrudan guverteye (kutu collision'inin ustu, yerel
          +0.035) oturuyor, yani /hook/contact aynen calisiyor ama temas
          yuzeyi 20 mm asagida. Gorev zaten vinci 0.40 m ile BILEREK fazla
          uzatip fizigin durdurmasina birakiyor (gz_payload_actuator.py
          HOOK_WINCH_EXTEND_M), o yuzden bu fark soguruluyor.

          TESPIT ETKISI: eski gri cikinti ustten bakinca yukun renkli
          yuzeyinde %4.2'lik gri bir ada aciyordu; artik acmiyor. Disk
          deligin dibinde ve neredeyse hic gorunmuyor, yani HSV doluluk
          orani ARTIYOR - esikten (HSV_COLOR_FRAC_RECT 0.40) daha da uzak.
        -->
        <visual name="target_disk_visual">
          <pose>0 0 0.0053 0 0 0</pose>
          <geometry><cylinder><radius>0.006</radius><length>0.001</length></cylinder></geometry>
          <material>
            <ambient>0.32 0.33 0.36 1</ambient>
            <diffuse>0.55 0.57 0.62 1</diffuse>
            <specular>0.9 0.9 0.9 1</specular>
          </material>
        </visual>
      </link>
    </model>

    <!-- ADR-011: BLUE-servo (Kirmizi Ucgen target) payload. Exists from world load and is held to the
         x500 by a DetachableJoint (see the vehicle model). Mounted LEFT (+y).
         Moved outboard to 0.28 m and down to its resting height for the
         same reason as payload_red above (F2: it was mounted through the
         landing skid, and detaching an interpenetrating pair ejects it).
         Colour is TRUE BLUE (operator requirement, 2026-08-17 F1); see
         payload_red above for the full rationale. Hue 118, S 238, V 191,
         inside the detector's [90,140] blue mask; separation is by size
         (87 px2 at 15 m vs HSV_MIN_AREA_HEX_BASE 800, a 9x margin).
         Cross-colour mapping: this BLUE payload is dropped on the RED
         triangle, so it never lies on a same-colour target.
         Mass 0.15 kg in simulation, NOT the real 1.05 kg: the sim x500 is a
         2.07 kg airframe, and two real payloads (+2.1 kg, +101%) would push
         thrust-to-weight and MPC_THR_HOVER far outside the tuning this SITL
         model ships with. Real value is recorded in real_system.yaml. -->
        <!--
      GERCEGE UYGUN OLCU/YERLESIM (operator, 2026-08-21). Onceki 0.30 x 0.225
      x 0.05 m govde ve -+0.28 m yan montaj gercek dusenegi yansitmiyordu.
      Yeni: uzun kenar 0.14, kisa kenar 0.05, yukseklik 0.07; iki yuk
      DRONE'UN TAM ALTINDA, uzun kenarlari gövde X'ine paralel, aralarinda
      2 cm bosluk -> merkezler y = -+0.035 (0.025 yarim genislik + 0.010
      yarim bosluk). Yerde dururken merkez z = 0.035 (yukseklik/2).

      Iniş takimi ile catisma yok: skid |y| araligi [0.1245, 0.1395], yukler
      |y| <= 0.06 - tamamen ice dusuyor, yani dunya SDF'sinin F2 notundaki
      "eklem cozulunce DART ic ice gecmis cifti gorup payload'i firlatiyor"
      tuzagina girmiyoruz.

      YAN FAYDA: yuk artik montaj noktasinda degil neredeyse govde
      merkezinde, yani "kamera hedefi ortaliyor ama yuk montaj noktasina
      dusuyor" sistematik hatasi 0.28 m'den ~0.035 m'ye iniyor.
    -->
    <model name="payload_blue">
      <pose>-0.035000 -25.000000 0.035 0 0 1.5707963268</pose>
      <link name="link">
        <inertial>
          <mass>0.15</mass>
          <inertia>
            <ixx>9.25e-5</ixx><iyy>3.06e-4</iyy><izz>2.76e-4</izz>
            <ixy>0</ixy><ixz>0</ixz><iyz>0</iyz>
          </inertia>
        </inertial>
        <!-- YUVA (BORE) COLLISION.
             Buradaki bloklar generate_bore_collision.py tarafindan URETILIR;
             marker'lar arasini elle duzenlemeyin. Profil (cep O46.50, pah-1
             23.20 derece, pah-2 46.97 derece, gecis deligi O22.00) ve faset
             sayisi N o script'te tek yerde tanimli.

             ONCEKI HALI tek bir kutuydu: <box><size>0.14 0.05 0.07</size></box>.
             O kutunun ust yuzeyi deck seviyesinde DUZ ve KAPALI oldugu icin
             kanca burnu yuvaya giremiyor, kapagin ustunde duruyordu; yanal
             kacisi engelleyen hicbir fiziksel sinir yoktu. Geometri zaten
             payload_body.stl icinde VARDI ve VISUAL olarak kullaniliyordu,
             yalnizca collision tarafinda atiliyordu. Uydurulmus bir sey
             eklenmedi; var olan yuzeyler tasindi. -->
        <!-- KURSAD_BORE_COLLISION_START -->
        <!-- URETILMIS BLOK -- generate_bore_collision.py yazar.
             ELLE DUZENLEME. Profil ve N o script'te tek yerde.
             Faset N=12, deck serit K=8, 83 kutu.
             CAD yuva: cep O46.50 (10.5mm derin), pah-1 23.20deg,
